config RODIN
	bool "Revenant /proc/rodin game-mode control interface"
	default y
	help
	  Kernel-owned control surface at /proc/rodin for the Revenant
	  game-mode stack (modes, thermal profile, whitelist, stats).

	  The companion app (RodinTools) writes here and the kernel applies
	  the levers internally, sidestepping the SELinux denials that block
	  the app from poking vendor sysfs directly (SCOPE I6/J5).

	  v0 is interface-only and performs no system mutation at boot, so it
	  cannot cause a bootloop. Say Y.
